            "rationale": "No Rust helper derives a module path from mod declarations for the guard to reuse; the guard stays a cargo-free shell derivation.",
            "failure_scenario": "If a shared resolver existed, a second derivation in the guard would drift from it; none was found at head.",
            "precision_class": "advisory"
          }
        },
